MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Blue & Lonesome and Step Back fit the blues guitar interest reflected in my recent Clapton and Hendrix listening; both felt compelling enough to choose today.",
    "Cass County and Traveller made sense alongside Blown Away, while Santana IV connected with my interest in guitar-led rock."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "25 did not connect with the blues and roots-oriented music I wanted today; a recognizable album alone was not enough to interest me.",
    "Magical Mystery Tour and Sgt. Pepper's leaned toward psychedelic pop rather than the blues sound I wanted, while the Eagles collection offered less incentive to explore another album."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in some classic rock seemed to be treated as interest in classic rock broadly, despite the differences between blues guitar and psychedelic pop.",
    "Familiar names seemed to carry too much weight when the particular album's sound mattered more to my choice."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The connection between my Clapton and Hendrix listening and my current appetite for blues guitar deserved more emphasis.",
    "An album can fit my interests without being something I would choose now; with only a couple of choices today, blues appealed more strongly than country or broader classic rock."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my interest in guitar-led rock and country, but only some captured the blues and roots sound that motivated my choices today."
}
